OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing to address slavery in Antigua as
OL,4,APM says he is open to possible UK
OL,5,Aapology
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III is to speak with
OL,8,F"unflinching honesty" and "sincere
OL,9,Fsorrow" on the lasting pain of the
OL,10,Ftransatlantic slave trade during the
OL,11,Ffinal leg of his Caribbean tour in
OL,12,FAntigua, Buckingham Palace has said.
OL,14,FThe King will address Commonwealth
OL,15,Fleaders on Tuesday in a speech that
OL,16,Fwill touch on the issue.
OL,18,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said
OL,19,Fearlier that he was "open" to the
OL,20,Fpossibility of the UK formally
OL,21,Fapologising for its role in slavery - a
OL,22,Fchange in the government's stance.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
