OL,3,AKing to address slavery in Antigua as
OL,4,APM says he is open to possible UK
OL,5,Aapology
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is understood the Palace was told in
OL,8,Fadvance of Burnham's comments in an
OL,9,Fopinion piece on Friday night, and that
OL,10,Fthe King has not made any changes to
OL,11,Fhis speech in light of them.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
